{"overview":"این سریال داستان سه فرزند یک والد بیمار را دنبال می‌کند: دو دختر وسواسی – صفیه و گولبن – و یک پسر – هان، که تمام عمر خود را به تأمین نیازهای خانواده اختصاص داده و بی‌وقفه بین کار و خانه می‌چرخد. روزی سرنوشت‌ساز، جهان هان به‌محض دیدن اینجی و عاشق شدن ناگهانی‌اش تغییر می‌کند؛ برای اولین بار در زندگی‌اش، هان به دنبال خوشبختی خودش می‌رود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The series follows the story of three siblings of a sick parent: two obsessive daughters – Safiye and Gülben and one son – Han, who has devoted his whole life to catering to his family's needs, shuttling tirelessly between work and home. One faithful day, Han's world will change as soon as he sees and immediately falls in love with İnci. For the first time in his life, Han will seek out his own happiness.","tagline_en":"","runtime":143,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":37,"y":2020,"poster":"/ulpQYbUI5VukApdMfziyQqvmQN4.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":34,"y":2021,"poster":"/5dxA16Aq70I6G2WG4JtXLleQqQh.jpg"}],"episodes":71,"crew":["Çağrı Vila Lostuvalı","Çiğdem Bozali","گلسرن بودایجی اوغلو"],"crew_en":["Çağrı Vila Lostuvalı","Çiğdem Bozali","Gülseren Budayıcıoğlu"],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Birkan Sokullu","role":"Han Derenoğlu","photo":"/55QxG1UURYvy1y2LP9aqLvCH1rj.jpg"},{"name":"Ezgi Mola","role":"Safiye Derenoğlu/Ataç","photo":"/dXZJOJr8bpUaCyUEBpNKs8e1Utx.jpg"},{"name":"Merve Dizdar","role":"Gülben Derenoğlu/Bilen","photo":"/3scsux2FwgVyiO0GikZy4f43eHd.jpg"},{"name":"Gizem Katmer","role":"Neriman Derenoğlu","photo":"/60Q8vlSqmXyqmeOVmfninLNJoKp.jpg"},{"name":"Metin Coşkun","role":"Hikmet Derenoğlu","photo":"/9DC5fEyZjG4PLVocb5nwvt1VWou.jpg"},{"name":"Esra Ruşan","role":"Esra Şafak","photo":"/kF9H4iMNorNRyoUdC5V9zbtiuHN.jpg"},{"name":"Uğur Uzunel","role":"Esat Bilen","photo":"/ajOgrYh7KmNraGnVXCnHTlgjhOx.jpg"},{"name":"Atilla Şendil","role":"Memduh Tınaz","photo":"/gk569GiJDIlzedI4Y0jHpMPtsa8.jpg"},{"name":"İpek Ayaz Kortunç","role":"Okşan Namık","photo":"/yEubi